  "roster_contract": "Existing sameeventseason/week ACT/source gates plus bound source-effective roster admission receipt; observed/effective clocks<=cutoff. ACT is a source status, not healthy/starter/appearance proof. Headers alone cannot qualify mismatched rosterweek.",
  "timing": "latesttrainavailable<fitcutoff<=profilecutoff<futurekickoff; exact origin; no targetgame in training; actual native scheduled status age0..1800s; historical/asof validator never issues through live path",
  "offers": "Absent line produces forecast-only. Callerline gives exactlaw probabilities but unqualified/hypothetical threshold. Qualified selection requires external admissionSHA, exact nativeplayer/event/rec/fullgameOT/comparator/venue/product/sides/line, OPENfresh observedquote and explicit unexpired lifecycle. Prices not required. No unoffered opposite side invented.",
  "probabilities": "Participation-conditioned experimental Leaf law; no validated confidence/EV/entry claim",
  "delivery": "No persistence, consumer admission, primary activation or newmodel fitting performed by adapter. Those remain separate owners/stages."
